the right hand side as well.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.540
So they are going to be
separated as a result.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:54.040
Now, being that they are separate,
we'll put a little plus sign to say,

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.600
hey, these two things are separate.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:00.109
And what we're going to be doing
is adding the H components in OH.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:06.329
So on the left side, we're going to be
