00:03:42.479 --> 00:03:46.410
Being that if you remember from general
chemistry or even your organic class.

00:03:46.795 --> 00:03:51.165
The carboxylic acid is the
acid and the amine is the base.

00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.015
So let's look first, we're going
