00:06:07.409 --> 00:06:12.909
So what we're going to be doing is we're
going to be trading positive components,

00:06:12.929 --> 00:06:17.969
kind of the same idea as if you ever watch
sports and you want to trade players or

00:06:17.969 --> 00:06:20.199
trade draft picks or anything like that.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.450
We are going to be trading
these two components.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:29.620
Now, when this happens, the carboxylic
